OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,-. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,,
OL,3,GNEWSASchoolfriends set to reunite after
OL,4,A60 years
OL,5,
OL,6,FFor children starting a new secondary
OL,7,Fschool this year social media means
OL,8,Fthey will likely always have a way of
OL,9,Fkeeping in touch with friends after
OL,10,Fthey leave.
OL,12,FBut for past generations it was very
OL,13,Fdifferent. Often the last day of school
OL,14,Fwas the last time you saw most class
OL,15,Fmates - even if you might not realise
OL,16,Fit at the time.
OL,18,FIt was something that prompted
OL,19,Fgrandmother Karen Feay to track down
OL,20,Fthe people she started Rivington &
OL,21,FBlackrod Grammar School in Bolton with
OL,22,F60 years ago.
OL,23,APub: 06-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,408,400,260,160,0,100
