OL,3,GNEWSASchoolfriends set to reunite after
OL,4,A60 years
OL,5,
OL,6,F"I bumped into an old school friend and
OL,7,Fwe got talking about our school
OL,8,Fmemories - and it snowballed from
OL,9,Fthere," she said. "We all started in
OL,10,F1966 which makes everyone 70 or 71
OL,11,Fyears old now."
